  "question": {
    "text": "If \\(M(\\alpha)=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}\\cos \\alpha & -\\sin \\alpha & 0 \\\\ \\sin \\alpha & \\cos \\alpha & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\\); \\(M(\\beta)=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}\\cos \\beta & 0 & \\sin \\beta \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -\\sin \\beta & 0 & \\cos \\beta\\end{array}\\right]\\) then \\([M(\\alpha) M(\\beta)]^{-1}\\) is equal to -",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "QanXI",
      "text": "\\(\\mathrm{M}(\\beta) \\mathrm{M}(\\alpha)\\)",
      "image": null,
